      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkumininaku Yoba hakwasama kukanwa kindi, hakushiŋa ifuku dindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoba hakuhosha nindi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku dinavwalikili mutenowu danoŋela, niwufuku weliluwu nawu lelu tunabaabi mwana weyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku odu mutenowu delili tuhu kwamwidima hohu; mutenowu Nzambi hadihwili kwindi mwiwuluku, mutenowu mwaana hiwaditoŋekeleluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutenowu nimwidima niwulelu wakufwa elili nawu, hiifuku detu; mutenowu delili tuhu kwachiwulu hohu, mutenowu ifuku odu kwiyila kwadu kudifwishi mutentu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenowu wufuku mutenowu awukwatili tuhu kudi mwidima waweni wakushishita, bayi wudibomba namafuku ahamwakaku, bayi awuchindila namutukwejuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wufuku owu wikali hakanka wawu, bayi mutiyakana izu dakuzaŋalalaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awushiŋi kudi ashiŋaŋa ifuku anyakalai; akumusaŋumuna chanzaŋombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tutumbwa twahakabwidibwidi kawu mutenowu tweyilili tuhu kwabwi-i, mutenowu wufuku owu watalilili mwaana talile-e ngo, mutenowu hiwamweni kuchaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanochu chiwabulili kwenzela yenzelu yevumu damama, nichiwabulili kusweka yihuŋu kumesu ami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabulililidi kufwila kunfuŋa? Nabulililidi kufwa hinafumini mwivumu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manuŋu antambwililidi? Mayeli aŋitijililidi kuyamwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi chelili chochochu mutenowu hanu nadikamina kwami zo-o, mutenowu nakamini dehi kwami tulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nadinookela dehi kwami hamu nawanyanta ninawaŋaji ahamaseki atuŋilaŋa nyikala yawu mumasaŋa akadi antu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hela nawatulamba ahetelaŋa wuru, enzeshelaŋa matalawu nasiliva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutenowu ansulumwini tuhu kwami, answeka neyi anyikeki abula kumona kunu kumwaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku kwalekaŋawu atama kukabisha akwawu, kwanookelaŋa azeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku kwanookelaŋawu antu amunyonji hamu, kwabulaŋawu kutiya izu damukwakukalakesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku kwekala niakadi kulema nialema; kwasubukilaŋa nduŋu kudi nkaka yindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi wakabakanaŋa amwitŋilaŋadi kumona kunu kumwaana? Niwatiyaŋa kulula kumuchima amwinkelaŋadi wumi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenowu atalilaŋa kufwa talile-e, kukumona nehi, hiyakukupunda chakubadika chapundaŋawu antu yuma yalema yaswekawu heseki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chakumonawu ŋamu, hiyakuzaŋalala nankashi, hiyakutiya kuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukweti njila yindi yakujinda, anakolekuwu ikoli kudi Nzambi, amwitŋilaŋadi kumona kunu kumwaana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudishishimona kwami kwabalumuka dehi neyi hikudya kwami, nikwaba kwami kunamwaŋali neyi meji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chuma chinatiyi woma chinanshintakeshi dehi, chuma chinaakama chinanwani dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinamoni kudi wunjikaku, hinamoni kumwenaku, hela kunooka hinachimonuku, yihuŋu chiyinza hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
